    "summary": "Dauntless Defenders begins at the start of battle round 1. Choose 2 objectives and put a circular 40 mm foundation marker in each. An IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit qualifies if any straight line connecting the markers intersects one of its models. Use the base for a based model and the hull for a baseless one. Against the Horde lets that unit disregard any combination of hit modifiers against visible enemies and grants [SUSTAINED HITS 1] to every weapon its models carry.",
